A DLL mod that lets you cancel animations to dodge and block quickly, without waiting for the animation to end.

[size=4][b]What does this mod do?[/b][/size]
In Elden Ring, after you swing a weapon or use a skill, you have to wait for its animation to finish before you can dodge or guard. This DLL mod lets you cancel the animation of attacks, weapon arts, sorceries and incantations with a dodge, a guard or a weapon swap.

[size=3][b][color=#5DADE2]Cancel incantations with a dodge or a weapon swap[/color][/b][/size]
[img]https://i.postimg.cc/0NMZXW1j/AnimCancel-1.gif[/img]

[size=3][b][color=#5DADE2]Cancel weapon arts with a dodge or a guard[/color][/b][/size]
[img]https://i.postimg.cc/x812WJGP/Anim-Cancel-2.gif[/img]

[size=3][b][color=#5DADE2]Cancel attacks with a guard[/color][/b][/size]
[img]https://i.postimg.cc/0jV8Qd29/Anim-Cancel-3.gif[/img]

[size=4][b][color=#E74C3C]Disclaimer: Only use in offline mode with EAC disabled![/color][/b][/size]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

Any DLL mod loader works, e.g. [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/117]Elden Mod Loader[/url], [url=https://github.com/soulsmods/ModEngine2/releases]Mod Engine 2[/url], [url=https://github.com/garyttierney/me3/releases]Mod Engine 3[/url].

[b]Option 1 - [url=https://github.com/soulsmods/ModEngine2/releases]Mod Engine 2[/url] (recommended)[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Download Mod Engine 2 from the link above and extract it into your game folder (the same folder as [i]eldenring.exe[/i]).[/*]
[*]Download this mod, then create a folder to hold it and its config file - for example, inside your game folder create a [b]natives[/b] folder.[/*]
[*]Open [b]config_eldenring.toml[/b] and edit [b]external_dlls = [ ][/b] to add the DLL, e.g.:
[code]external_dlls = [
    "natives\\AnimCancel.dll",
][/code]
[/*]
[*]Launch the game using Mod Engine 2's launcher, [b]modengine2_launcher.exe[/b].[/*]
[/list]

[b]Option 2 - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/117]Elden Mod Loader[/url][/b]
[list=1]
[*]Download Elden Mod Loader from the link above and extract it into your game folder.[/*]
[*]Download this mod and drag [b]AnimCancel.dll[/b] and [b]AnimCancel.toml[/b] into the [b]mods[/b] folder.[/*]
[*]Launch the game - the mod will be loaded automatically.[/*]
[/list]

